{"title":"2023 CMO(CHINA) Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CMO(CHINA)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the smallest real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/4/ce4588fd900d02afcbd260bc07f54cce49a7dc4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lambda$\" width=\"10\" height=\"13\" /> such that any positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> can be expressed as the product of 2023 positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/6/3169c43526eefeeddc70d7ab81a1b50132e0edb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=x_1 x_2 \\cdots x_{2023}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"138\" height=\"13\" />, where for each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9d73b684f6f05298418cc5d2c7c797b209cacb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i \\in$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/6/bc6cadbb65dac95c2d68eb1a57f9d0ded94fd58c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1,2, \\ldots, 2023\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"123\" height=\"20\" />, either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/b/67bc6daa9d6b964201d6cef60cbeb1ac5fd26ead.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> is a prime number or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/5/1758a5596992075eece6870c5fc3d41c7f19f181.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_i \\leq n^\\lambda$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CMO(CHINA)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>1. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/8/3d8737dedf88d1affe339c68616c53ae91118eb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=2^{2024}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"17\" />. Then there exist <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/3/a33e8d543e713d89698135403785122dd0996e06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_i \\geq 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/e/64e7e0466eb468a805e71f2f00f9681f05962ca0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lambda \\geq \\frac{1}{1012}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"77\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>2. Assume\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/b/5eb4d478f1e6685f36d47d6506645118bef982b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=x_1 x_2 \\cdots x_{1012} p_1 p_2 \\cdots p_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"215\" height=\"13\" />\nwhere <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/4/a14a93111b53fbcae28d35a15b5e000a2ad3419b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1 \\sim x_{1012} \\in \\mathbb{N}^{+}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"128\" height=\"20\" />and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/b/8ab059afeae9cf9d44953c0c5e18d820264cd975.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_i \\leq n^{\\frac{1}{1012}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"22\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/d/27de8b855dcd20bb3136bc482120ef539fbca9e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_i p_j&gt;n^{\\frac{1}{1012}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"96\" height=\"24\" />. Also, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/6/0e66792b8715d9adf3914a9e9c9a8246a03aa0b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p_1 \\leq p_2 \\leq$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"78\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/5/22598e5e9136f53a21b62f4dc637217944a0d1be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cdots \\leq p_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"17\" /> be primes and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/4/a94361b63a1ec6046412ae4e6c0a4b2febc9ceb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1 \\leq x_2 \\leq \\cdots \\leq x_{1012}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"169\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>We will show that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/7/b575a970ad2abfac0de4ee7d72bd00c5969337b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\leq 1011$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"72\" height=\"17\" />.\nSuppose otherwise, that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/c/d9c588a42454778f7198551a1873eb7f946655e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\geq 1012$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"72\" height=\"17\" />. Then\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/5/bb5f4f054f5a93f5822eedb7e6d666795f4709a0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n \\geq x_1^{1012} \\cdot p_1^{1012} \\Rightarrow x_1 p_1 \\leq n^{\\frac{1}{1012}}\\]\" width=\"245\" height=\"22\" />\nwhich leads to a contradiction.\nTherefore, the minimum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/4/ce4588fd900d02afcbd260bc07f54cce49a7dc4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lambda$\" width=\"10\" height=\"13\" /> is:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/2/7a2092bad4dee81078c7178b6d11b8302a15d814.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\lambda_{\\min }=\\frac{1}{1012}\\]\" width=\"95\" height=\"37\" />\n~moving|szm\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CMO(CHINA)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CMO(CHINA)\" title=\"2023 CMO(CHINA)\">2023 CMO(CHINA)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CMO(CHINA)_Problems\" title=\"2023 CMO(CHINA) Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27&amp;year=2023\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CMO(CHINA)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2023 CMO(CHINA) Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CMO(CHINA)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2023 CMO(CHINA) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CMO(CHINA)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2023 CMO(CHINA) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CMO(CHINA)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2023 CMO(CHINA) Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CMO(CHINA)_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2023 CMO(CHINA) Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CMO(CHINA)_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2023 CMO(CHINA) Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CMO(CHINA)_Problems_and_Solutions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"CMO(CHINA) Problems and Solutions\"> All CMO(CHINA) Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 2026101802